      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The tough has two bone shards in hand</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The tough attempts to use one shard of bone to hammer another into a creature, creating a gaping wound. The tough attempts an athletics|defense:reflex check against the target's Reflex DC. On a hit, the target takes the listed bone shard damage and 1d4 Bleed Damage.</p>",
